WEBVTT

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:05.600
I'm exhausted.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.650
We were one of the last teams 
to finish the dice game.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.110
And then we came in dead last.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:15.610
I really am sorry I'm so useless.

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:21.050
I guess it was ridiculous to think 
I could be helpful as a squid.

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:24.600
While I'm at it, I should apologize
for being born in the first place...

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.300
<i>Did you like being a squid that much?</i>

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.010
Strawberry au lait!

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:29.470
Strawberry au lait!

00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:30.550
Thanks for waiting!

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.080
I'm sorry!

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.220
Framboise!

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:39.140
My strawberry au lait...

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:41.920
Hanako, are you okay?

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:44.030
You really do have terrible luck.

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:45.140
Have a tissue.

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:48.150
Thanks.

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:57.910
<i>She saved me back then so no one 
would find out about him.</i>

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:02.160
Hey, Hanako...

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:04.220
What is it, Hibari-chan?

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:06.230
At the end of the happiness training...

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:09.400
You were covering for me, right?

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.000
Th-Thank you.

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:12.090
Huh?

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:13.260
Huh?

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.700
If you weren't, just forget it!

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:18.670
What? Forget what?

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:19.500
Never mind!

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:19.960
Huh? What?

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:21.980
Didn't we come to discuss our homework?

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:23.270
Let's get started!

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:24.650
Okay.

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:26.620
So it's a strategy meeting, is it?

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:59.450
<b>Faculty Office</b>

00:02:58.120 --> 00:02:59.450
Lucky items?

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:03.870
Yes, a trustworthy witch doctor selected 
them based on the data we gathered

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:06.410
on the three of you who finished last.

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:10.730
Please turn in the items written here
by the start of next week.

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:12.370
A witch doctor?

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:16.130
<b>April 29</b>

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:16.130
<b>Episode 4</b>

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:16.130
<b>A Mysterious Penalty</b>

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:25.280
Just taking a picture of what's supposed 
to be a "lucky item" seems a bit lax...

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:26.470
What did you get, Botan?

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:29.560
"A wonderful memory with friends."

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:30.180
Huh?

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:33.500
That sounds nice! I got a flower.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:34.650
It has a long name...

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:40.400
It's, uh... "The flower of happiness 
that blooms at the gate of dawn."

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:42.530
What is that? An item from a video game?

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:46.200
It says it can be found here in town.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.240
What's yours, Hibari-san?

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:48.220
Huh?

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:51.960
M-Mine will be easy.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.560
I should be able to do it at home.

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:54.920
What is it? Now I'm curious!

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.380
Tell me, tell me!

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:02.800
M-My "best smile."

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:08.220
I'll do anything I can to help.

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:09.320
Me, too!

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:10.720
I can do it myself!

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:13.150
Don't say that.

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:14.940
We have tomorrow off.

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.680
Why don't we all get together?

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:17.650
Yeah!

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:22.650
Fine.

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:25.360
Huh? We still haven't gotten our cake.

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:29.440
Let's meet at the park near the school at 1:00.

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:32.220
Okay. I can't wait.

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:33.580
Let's have tons of fun!

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:35.830
We're meeting to do our homework.

00:04:36.610 --> 00:04:38.030
Did you hear that, Ren?

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:39.250
Sorry, I wasn't listening.

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:41.610
They're looking for their lucky items?

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:42.970
If they do that,

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:46.010
we'll become the most
unfortunate students in class!

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:48.480
I thought you liked being the "most" anything.

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:51.820
There's no point in a rank if no one can see it!

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:54.270
Ren, we're following them tomorrow!

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:55.740
What?

00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:58.020
Don't sound like it's such a pain!

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:00.770
In fact, now and then...

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:07.340
I-It wouldn't be so bad to spend 
the weekend with me, would it?

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.910
After all, we're childhood friends...

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:16.280
That's why it's such a pain.
And there's you-know-what...

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:18.000
Don't say that!

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:20.500
Fine.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.790
Come on. This way.

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:26.220
I can borrow Dad's camera...

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:31.890
Since we'll be looking for things, 
should I wear comfortable clothes?

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:37.560
Or, since it's the weekend, should I wear 
the special dress I almost never wear?

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:40.800
This isn't a date!

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:45.650
I'm worrying too much.

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:50.120
It's just been so long since I've gone 
out on the weekend with friends...

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:52.500
<i>Four hours later...</i>

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:56.750
Botan-sama, these are your clothes for tomorrow.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.080
Thank you for your help.

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:03.020
It seems a bit tight...

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:06.470
Have I... gained weight?

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:09.790
Goodness me. I'm sorry.

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:12.780
Sayuri-sama's clothes were mixed in with yours.

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:13.930
It's Sayu-chan's?

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:16.120
That's a relief...

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:19.070
How's this? It's not weird, is it?

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:20.900
You look great.

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:24.110
About ten more should be enough...

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:24.970
Huh?

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:26.320
Nothing.

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.510
Their names are Hibari-chan 
and Botan-chan, right?

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:30.610
You've made some nice friends.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:32.010
Yeah!

00:06:33.140 --> 00:06:35.080
<i>Maybe I'll fold some cranes.</i>

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:39.040
Hibari-san! Over here.

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:43.000
Sorry. It took me a while to get ready.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.500
It's not a problem.

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:50.530
Wh-What?

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:52.980
Your dress is so cute.

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:55.560
Th-Thanks.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.020
And your coat looks...

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:59.600
really expensive.

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:01.760
Oh, um...

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:06.960
Embarrassingly enough, I've never 
bought clothes for myself before.

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:10.070
If anything about it is unbearable to look at...

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:12.940
It's not that at all. It's cute.

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:15.920
Thank you.

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:18.710
Hanako doesn't seem to be here yet.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:24.280
What's this? One of them is still missing.

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:25.440
Zzz...

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:27.740
Ren, wake up!

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:30.360
Oh, sorry. It was so warm, I couldn't help it.

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:36.090
Don't touch Ren!

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:37.810
Bad cat, bad cat!

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:40.520
Hanakoizumi Anne

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:40.520
It's Hanako-san.

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:42.480
Hello?

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:44.440
Sorry...

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:48.190
I left home at eight just to be safe,

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:51.860
but I kept falling into manholes and rivers.

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:51.860
Sploosh!

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:55.120
I've come back home about ten times to change.

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:57.940
You can start on the homework without me...

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.060
Well, that's that.

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:04.840
I guess we should have expected as much.

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:06.120
What should we do?

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:07.850
We don't have much time,

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:11.840
so let's gather information
on Hanako's homework first,

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:13.340
since it seems the most difficult.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:14.120
Okay.

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:15.930
They're already on the move.

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:18.720
Is the item that difficult to find?

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:19.680
Ren, let's go.

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:22.220
What, again?!

00:08:22.970 --> 00:08:24.860
Beat it! Scram!

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:30.410
Stay away!

00:08:58.780 --> 00:09:01.080
<b>We apologize for the inconvenience.</b>

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:02.940
We meet again.

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:09.290
This is the fourth one.

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:11.980
Why do they keep visiting flower shops?

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:13.840
Gate of dawn?

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:15.680
Flower of happiness?

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:17.850
I'm sorry. I don't know.

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:19.260
Of course not.

00:09:19.970 --> 00:09:23.850
But there is someone who knows 
a lot about the local flora.

00:09:23.850 --> 00:09:25.000
Really?

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:28.000
Here!

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:28.000
Grandma Ume on Third Street.

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:32.000
She used to be in charge of caring for 
the flowers at the botanical garden.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.930
She's always out in the sun.

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:35.080
Why don't you go ask her?

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:36.740
Thank you.

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:39.050
They're booking it.

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:42.490
That looks yummy!

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:45.890
They found us?!

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:47.480
Want a bite?

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:48.190
Really?

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:49.580
I won't allow it!

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:51.260
No, wait! Let's run!

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:53.340
I'll drop my ice cream...

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:54.820
You always do this, Ren! Always!

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:57.370
<i>A date?</i>

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:08.730
Looks like we lost her.

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:13.100
How?! Are you a ninja or something?!

00:10:13.100 --> 00:10:14.920
Huh? I've been here the whole time.

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:18.440
Hibiki, your you-know-what brought 
us back to where we started.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:19.510
What?

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:23.010
Hey, hey! Are you two out together today?

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:26.980
<i>She hasn't realized what I'm up to?</i>

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:28.910
No, it's not like that.

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:30.280
That's exactly right.

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:32.780
Now, if you get the hint, go away.

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:33.960
Oh, really?

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:38.190
Since I ran into you, I was hoping 
we could all hang out together.

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:40.760
With you guys? No way!

00:10:41.650 --> 00:10:43.870
Kitty! It's a kitty!

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.870
No! They're here?

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:47.660
Stray kitties!

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:51.080
So forward...

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:53.460
Quit hanging on Ren!

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:58.360
Sorry. You won't listen to Hibiki 
because she's so loud, huh?

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:00.740
<b>Rrrumble</b>

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:08.100
Still so forward...

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:10.070
There's no end to them.

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:12.840
End of the Century...

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:17.820
W-We're surrounded.

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:19.950
You homewrecking cats!

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:26.370
Kitties! So many kitties!

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:40.220
Are you okay?

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:42.570
Yeah, I'm used to it.

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:45.120
You're used to this?

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:46.830
Your life must be hard.

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:47.970
No, not at all.

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:49.900
I even got to touch them a little.

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:52.470
A little?

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:55.610
Hibari-chan!

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:57.020
What?

00:11:57.420 --> 00:11:58.300
Follow them!

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:00.030
Red bean buns and milk?

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:04.750
The flower of happiness that 
blooms at the gate of dawn...

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:06.950
Have you heard of it?

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:08.490
I have an idea.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:10.410
Could you tell us where to find it?

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:11.210
No!

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:11.960
Huh?

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:16.420
There are so many people who 
mistreat flowers these days.

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:18.640
We would never do that.

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:20.620
We just want to take a picture of it.

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:21.320
Hmph!

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:25.980
We heard she was difficult, but...

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:27.390
Hibari-chan! Botan-chan!

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:28.990
H-Hanako.

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:30.640
Sorry I'm late.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:32.560
I'm glad you're all right.

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:37.020
You could've called Botan's cell
from a public phone.

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:39.400
I was about to, but...

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:41.340
Come on out!

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:42.570
Don't call us over!

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:43.900
You two?

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.690
They were with me the whole time.

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:49.720
Th-This blockhead was out 
wandering around town,

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:51.330
so we were just looking after her.

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:54.010
Can I go now?

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:55.760
Please wait!

00:12:55.760 --> 00:12:56.750
Whoops...

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:01.710
Here you go.

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:03.280
Ba-dump!

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:10.140
An... An angel...

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:12.120
She's acting strangely.

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:15.370
Yes, it's as though she's being controlled.

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:17.020
Again?

00:13:17.370 --> 00:13:20.250
Again? You know what's going on?

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:23.150
Ren has always been peculiar 
since she was a child.

00:13:23.840 --> 00:13:26.410
You could say she's...

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:29.160
If she's your friend, then I have no choice.

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:33.820
I'll tell you where to find 
the flower of happiness.

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:37.170
My sweet angel...

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:41.130
The flower of happiness is in the 
botanical garden at the top of the hill.

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:44.600
There do seem to be a lot of flowers,

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:47.510
but she didn't even tell us what it looks like.

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:49.130
This could be back-breaking work.

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:51.360
I feel like my back might break already...

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:53.100
You should rest before it breaks.

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:57.550
Hey, did you already take the pictures 
you both need for your homework?

00:13:57.550 --> 00:13:58.650
Not yet.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:02.520
So you've been helping me this whole time?

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:04.040
Thanks!

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:09.070
What are you doing, Botan?

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:13.490
I thought it was a good opportunity
to capture your best smile...

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:16.370
I said not to worry about mine!

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:18.360
I want to take one, too.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:18.710
<b>Whuff</b>

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:20.490
Huh?

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:23.880
I heard you fell into a
river on your way here.

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:23.590
<b>On your way here...</b>

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:25.740
Then of course it's broken!

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:26.720
Oh, right.

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:30.170
If we get a picture, I'll send it to you later.

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:31.680
By the way,

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:34.060
why are there five of us now?

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:39.100
We're just going the same way!

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:40.510
Don't get the wrong idea!

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:43.520
There's no way I, Hibiki, would 
want to hang out with you!

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:45.240
Is that so?

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:49.050
<i>She's been really mean to me lately.</i>

00:14:49.050 --> 00:14:50.700
<i>Did I do something to her?</i>

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.330
I see it!

00:14:58.180 --> 00:14:59.290
It's beautiful.

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:02.920
There are all kinds of flowers!

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:05.770
What's this one?

00:15:05.770 --> 00:15:06.810
Oxalis.

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:08.810
You know a lot about flowers.

00:15:08.810 --> 00:15:12.220
The flower of happiness must be 
shaped like happiness, right?

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:14.360
Like a four-leaf clover, maybe?

00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:16.160
Those are just leaves.

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:19.610
In the language of flowers,
I feel like it could be lily of the valley,

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:21.690
but there's no way it's that simple...

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:23.690
E-Excuse me...

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:23.690
<b>Excuse me...</b>

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:25.610
My bones are all right,

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:28.750
but I seem to have shortened 
my lifespan quite a bit.

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.720
Would it be all right if I took a—

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:31.910
Please rest immediately!

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:34.370
It's already four.

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:38.520
The garden closes at six, 
so there's no time to lose.

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:41.290
First we need to find the gate of dawn...

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:45.040
It's probably not the gate at the peak.

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:50.260
Despite the situation,

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:52.940
my goal hasn't changed.

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:55.580
I'll never let you find happiness!

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.610
Feeling better?

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:11.490
Yes, thank you.

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:14.070
The sun is already setting.

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:16.760
You're right. We might be in trouble.

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:25.380
Look, you guys!

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:35.790
The gate of dawn...

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:36.990
That must be it!

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:39.890
Then the flower of happiness 
must be close to it!

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:42.430
You're right. Let's go.

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:45.440
Slow down, please...

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:48.360
It says this is a flower maze.

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:50.880
Apparently it's a popular date spot.

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:52.920
And the gate is on the other side?

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:54.110
It seems that way.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:55.720
Then let's go!

00:16:55.720 --> 00:16:56.560
Yeah.

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:58.100
Let's go, too.

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:02.940
It's beautiful.

00:17:02.940 --> 00:17:05.340
What a magical place.

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:07.120
Make sure you don't get separated.

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:08.290
Okay!

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:15.630
I-I was just thinking I'd like to go on 
a walk somewhere romantic with Ren!

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.620
L-Let's try that way!

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:26.680
At this rate, we'll become the most 
unfortunate students in class.

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:29.030
Don't you have any good ideas, Ren?

00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:32.190
Ren?

00:17:36.460 --> 00:17:38.520
Ren! Where are you?

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:40.580
Ren! Ren!

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:43.790
Where are you?!

00:17:58.240 --> 00:18:01.010
Don't leave me alone...

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:01.970
I found you!

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:10.020
What are you doing here?

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:13.730
I wanted all of us to walk together.

00:18:19.810 --> 00:18:20.540
Huh?

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:21.660
What's wrong?

00:18:23.090 --> 00:18:23.870
I'm stuck.

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:26.340
Huh?

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:27.830
What should I do?

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:38.240
I thought I'd be stuck forever.

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:39.300
Thanks.

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.510
Now we're even, got it?

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:42.520
Huh?

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:47.640
Nothing good ever happens when I'm with you.

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:49.840
Were you lost?

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:54.400
It's not like I want to go with you or anything.

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:56.730
There they are.

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:59.180
Sorry for making you wait again.

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:00.730
It's fine.

00:19:00.730 --> 00:19:03.100
It'd be weird for us to walk separately, anyway.

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:06.700
Hey.

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:08.410
Ren!

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:11.290
Where have you been?

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:30.750
This place is beautiful, as well.

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:32.220
We've made it this far.

00:19:32.220 --> 00:19:34.360
We have to find the flower of happiness.

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:35.060
Yeah!

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:39.550
Is this it?

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:40.990
I don't think so.

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:52.090
<i>The garden will be closing soon.</i>

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:57.270
<i>Thank you for visiting the 
Mifune Botanical Gardens today.</i>

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:57.740
Oh, no...

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:00.020
But we were so close.

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:07.110
We couldn't find it...

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:14.330
What a joke.

00:20:15.680 --> 00:20:20.280
I knew the whole time that you were 
working on your penalty homework.

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:24.820
I meant to get in your way if you 
managed to find your lucky items,

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:27.830
but I didn't even have to do anything.

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:29.400
Oh, my...

00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:31.150
That was your ulterior motive?

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:32.650
You're not mad?

00:20:32.650 --> 00:20:34.120
No, but I am disgusted.

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:37.530
I got to hang out not just with 
Hibari-chan and Botan-chan,

00:20:37.530 --> 00:20:40.090
but also with Hibiki-chan and Ren-chan.

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:42.050
Today was a great day.

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:48.920
Let me see that camera.

00:20:48.920 --> 00:20:49.980
Go ahead.

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:57.340
I'll capture your stupid faces in a photo.

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:04.500
Let's go home, Ren.

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:06.970
Okay.

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:14.940
Sheesh. We should've used a timer 
to take a picture of all five of us.

00:21:15.760 --> 00:21:19.590
I'm sure we'll have plenty 
of other opportunities.

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:21.090
We're classmates, after all.

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:22.650
You're right.

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:33.400
Wh-What?

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:34.390
It's nothing.

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:36.570
You wouldn't smile if it was nothing.

00:21:36.570 --> 00:21:37.580
What is it?

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:38.480
Nothing.

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:40.380
What is it? Tell me!

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:41.650
You're so persistent.

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:43.650
<b>Faculty Office</b>

00:21:42.640 --> 00:21:46.680
So you were unable to find 
the flower of happiness?

00:21:46.680 --> 00:21:47.360
Yeah...

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:50.680
We were close, though.

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:53.230
We took a picture of the gate of dawn,

00:21:53.230 --> 00:21:55.080
so maybe you could overlook this.

00:21:57.090 --> 00:21:59.790
Oh, you did manage to capture it.

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:01.090
Huh?

00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:03.870
They call it the gate of dawn

00:22:03.870 --> 00:22:06.510
because it's easier to find at sunrise.

00:22:07.120 --> 00:22:12.250
You were very fortunate to be 
able to find it in the evening.

00:22:12.250 --> 00:22:14.890
This is the flower of happiness?

00:22:14.890 --> 00:22:17.570
That's the picture Hibiki-chan took.

00:22:17.570 --> 00:22:18.480
That girl...

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:21.770
It's also a photo of Hibarigaoka-san's smile

00:22:21.770 --> 00:22:26.200
and Kumegawa-san making
memories with her friends.

00:22:26.200 --> 00:22:30.450
I'll count this single photo as fulfilling 
all three of your assignments.

00:22:33.410 --> 00:22:37.620
I'm glad you were able to have 
such a wonderful weekend.

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:39.160
Yeah!

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>May 9</b>

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>Getting Lost on the Way to School</b>

00:23:40.060 --> 00:23:43.060
<b>Don't miss the next episode!</b>
